WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:04.410
Man, I'm freezing!

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:05.750
That's because it's winter.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.750
Who said it was okay
for winter to start?

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:12.090
You're cold because you sold your coat
without considering the consequences.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.090
And what on earth are those?

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.760
Emergency food?

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:17.430
He says they're paw pads...

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.760
Aren't they slick?

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.430
I don't understand...

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.730
I don't understand
your sense at all!

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.110
Hey! Don't go
blowing snot on me!!

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.780
I- it sure is cold,
I guess...

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
Honestly, at least
fix the heater!

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:37.780
We don't have
that kind of money!

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.120
Why!?

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.120
I help out a lot with your
sweeper work too!

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.790
It's because you shovel
down food like a pig!

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.280
You've been leeching off me
for six long months!

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.130
By the way, Eve,
what're you reading?

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:58.800
"The Desperate Trio:
Their Escape from The Pits"...

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.400
Sounds like you're reading
a difficult book...

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.410
Idiot. Eve's trying to improve
this situation in her own way, so...

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.080
Man, I'm freezing...

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:10.410
If you wanna complain,

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:13.080
complain after
you capture this guy.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.150
Ha! Okay, then!

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:16.750
A small fish like this,
I can do it alone...

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:17.420
Me, too...

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:19.090
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.090
I'll do it, too.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:22.090
Do what?

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:26.760
If we capture that person,
we'll get money, right?

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.430
It's too difficult for you!

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:34.770
Anyway, you can just leave this guy to me
and go quietly read a book or something...

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:39.440
Then, Train, do you wanna
compete with me... in a game of tag?

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:45.120
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:52.280
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:11.410
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:17.750
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:24.090
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:30.430
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:36.930
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:43.440
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.440
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:56.440
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.200
"Traveling Cat"

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.750
Boss! We really did it!

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.750
Don't get excited
with small change.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:31.420
That's our boss!
You've got a large caliber!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:35.420
In any case, the effect of that
drink was really something!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:37.760
Please let me have
some too next time...

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:38.920
Boss?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.390
Where are you going
to spend your vacation?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.050
I haven't decided yet...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.390
Then, I'd love for you
to come to my vacation home.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:12.730
You can stay
as long as you want.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.730
If you want,
y- you can stay forever...

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.730
I have to go now...

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.400
Where to?

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.470
That's a secret...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:38.410
Tada! Here it is.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.420
With my skills, stuff like
this is a piece of cake!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.430
There you are!

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.520
You playin' hide and sheek?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.430
Umm, who might you be?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:57.100
Come on, Elena-<i>san,</i>
you must be drunk.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.770
It's me! Me!

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.040
Why don't we shhpend our vacation
together at my vacation home?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.380
You can't be...

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.870
No vacashionn...
Haha...

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:11.720
So, I shee you like books.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.720
Y- yes...

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:18.060
especially things like
medieval Italian literature...

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:22.730
I love that shtuff, too,
that Italian whatever...

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:27.740
Oh? Elena-<i>san,</i>
this is...

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:30.070
Looks like you saw it...

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:33.410
Yes... I saw it.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.070
In that case,
I have no choice!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.750
How about a cocktail?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.420
I'm in a hurry, so...

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:49.760
Don't be like that.
Have a drink with me...

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.430
Rinslet Walker, the thief...

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:56.100
Who are you?

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.530
I'm Jenos Hazard.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.710
Chrono Numbers!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:14.380
The name of the cocktail is "Fate".

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.720
In token of our new
acquaintanceship...

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:19.390
Stealing a confidential document
within only five minutes...

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.060
What a skill...

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.390
If you've got something
to say, hurry up and say it.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:27.730
Cinderella doesn't
have much time, huh?

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.730
Elena-<i>san</i>!

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:33.400
What do you want?

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:38.070
Half a year ago, I was
pursuing Torneo's bio-weapon...

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.740
I was taking over for Black Cat,
who left Chronos.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:45.750
While I was investigating,
I came across your name.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.750
Your skills are amazing,
getting the better of Chronos.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.750
Well, that's not
important any more...

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.760
The situation has
changed a little,

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.430
and we don't have time
for that right now.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:07:00.700
A force that opposes
Chronos has appeared.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.030
Opposes Chronos?

00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:05.030
What a reckless bunch...

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.370
They're a group of Tao users.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.540
Tao?

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:12.040
It's an uncanny power that
has been passed down in Itairiku.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:17.710
The Tao users were eradicated
by Chronos 20 years ago.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:23.720
But lately, there have been
criminals who use that power.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.720
With power like that of a monster,
they did whatever they pleased.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:31.060
But, in every case, their bodies
destroyed themselves.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:34.400
There have been three
incidents like that up until now.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:37.060
The common thread among them is that,
before they committed crimes,

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:41.070
they were visited
by a suspicious duo.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.400
Are those two also Tao users?

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.070
Probably...

00:07:45.070 --> 00:07:47.440
I heard that the three
who gained the power of Tao

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:52.080
were given a strange
drink by that duo.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.750
A drink that gives you
the power of Tao by drinking it...

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.420
It's interesting, isn't it?

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.180
Are you asking me
to steal it!?

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:07.030
The three that died an unnatural
death had something in common.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:10.360
They all escaped from the
same prison half a year ago.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.530
The Office of Investigations

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:15.040
thinks there was someone
who helped them from the outside.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.370
These two are the ones that remain.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.380
The Tao user duo
will probably visit these two.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:25.380
If you know that much,
why don't you steal it yourself?

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:28.380
I don't want to aggravate
the matter at this point.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:31.720
I need your thief skills.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.390
Find someone else.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:35.390
10 million gold...

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.320
Plus necessary expenses...

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.230
How is that?

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.060
Shoot!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.730
That wasn't nice, Elena-<i>san</i>!

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.070
My heart's pounding!

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.070
Why are you following me!?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.070
I feel like you're my fate.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.540
I'm gonna slug you!!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:06.020
I wanna hear about the duo
that came to see your boss.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.020
What were they like?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.020
If you don't tell me,
I'll hit you again!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:13.360
A- a man with a hat
and a young woman.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.700
And!?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:19.370
We were told that the man with the hat
helped our boss to escape from prison.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:23.700
Our boss told us he had to help
that man as a token of his gratitude.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.710
But your boss died...

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.370
It's their fault.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:29.380
They made our boss...

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.710
Drink something...

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.200
Is there some left?

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:41.720
Begafurt, Rubek City,

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.730
Desburg...

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:46.960
Considering the route they're taking,
it should be this way.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:51.990
You shouldn't do that.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.410
Flowers are alive, too.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.750
I'll teach you
a lot about flowers.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.750
Okay!

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.740
I've looked all over for you, Igor.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.090
I'll teach you next time, okay?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.190
Okay...

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.440
Charden-<i>san...</i>

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:34.780
The battle with Chronos
will start soon.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.780
I want to...

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:38.440
...live here quietly.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.450
You mean an escaped prisoner
lives in a rural area like this?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:45.790
I got the information from Annette.
It's definitely correct.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.450
Three miles to the town.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.460
We aren't there yet!

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:51.020
Help me push the car.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.960
We're out of gas.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:06.070
I'm exhausted...

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.080
Let's hurry up
and go capture him.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.410
Igor Planter.
Occupation: Forest Keeper

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:15.420
Seems like he's
your average guy.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.420
There's no need to rush.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:21.760
We don't even know where he is.
Let's take a break.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:24.090
Then, I'll go look
for him by myself.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:28.760
See, this is why I think that an
innocent princess'll give us trouble.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.430
Princess?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:32.100
A princess, huh?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.430
You got a point there.

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.200
So, what can I get for you?

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.010
Oh?

00:11:47.110 --> 00:11:48.780
--Ahhh!
--Ahhh!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.780
You're that waitress
from Blakio City...

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.790
You're the pops who
skipped out on your bills!

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:55.790
Don't say things
that'll hurt my reputation!

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:59.130
This brings back memories!
It's been half a year, hasn't it?

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:02.400
Why are you here?

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.730
A lot has happened
to me since then...

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.900
I quit that restaurant
and broke up with that guy.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.740
--Then, I traveled to that
country and met that guy.
--Man, I'm hungry...

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:09.740
--Then, I broke up with that guy
and met that man, and...
--I'll have this, this, this and this...

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.410
--I'd like this one.
--Then, I broke up with that guy
and met that man, and...

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.070
--Oh, that one?
--Now what do I want?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.070
Oh, and, this one, too.

00:12:14.070 --> 00:12:16.410
--Hey, listen!!
--Huh?

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:21.080
<i>Daughter...</i>
<i>Not sure... Father...</i>

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.740
So you've got a complicated
family structure...

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.090
--Brrr, I'll have some hot milk, please!
--Hey, isn't there any meat?

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:31.090
Vegetables are nutritious.

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:35.100
That's right! And you're scarfing
it down while you're complaining!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.100
Hey!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.590
What are you guys doing
in a place like this!?

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.440
Why is that assassin here?

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.780
A lot happened...

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:52.110
Hey! I'll settle for the cheap stuff,
so bring me more food!

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:55.450
Tao users?
What's that about?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:59.120
It's a mysterious militant group
that uses uncanny techniques.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.060
Uncanny techniques?

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:05.560
In any case, it seems that these two
have been building up a circle of allies

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.220
by having vicious criminals
drink some strange drink.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.390
Now, drink it.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:17.400
What happens
when I drink it?

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.410
You may get
an amazing power,

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:22.410
or you may die.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.750
Did you drink it, too?

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:27.410
It's incredibly effective.

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:29.080
First you take a sip.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:32.750
Then once your body becomes familiar
with the Tao power, you take another sip.

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:37.760
If you go too fast, your cells
won't be able to bear the rapid change.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.090
Who commissioned you
to pursue those two?

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.100
Chronos...

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:44.100
When did you start
working with them?

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.100
Don't worry.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:51.110
I didn't tell them
about Eve, so...

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:53.440
I read the article.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.440
He couldn't do it...

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.450
He couldn't control
his own power.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:01.050
Will I be like him?

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:06.390
You said you wanted the power
to get revenge on society.

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.390
Th- that was just...

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:12.390
I didn't do anything wrong,
but I was apprehended...

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:15.730
--so, I was angry...
--Oh! I know!

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:19.400
That's called a false
accusation, right!?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:21.070
That's right.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:24.900
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:37.080
So, the Tao users are so dangerous
that Chronos keeps an eye on them?

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:40.090
I heard that they can fight
on par with the Numbers.

00:14:40.090 --> 00:14:41.760
S- seriously!?

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.260
--On the house!
--Yeah!

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.760
Oh, these are just
bread crusts...

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.090
Be happy you got this!

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:49.430
So, why are they in this town?

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:54.770
Half a year ago, a man with a hat helped
five vicious criminals escape from prison.

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:58.110
One of them is in this town...

00:14:58.110 --> 00:15:00.130
--This guy!
--Igor-<i>san</i>!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.050
You know him!?

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:10.050
Where!?
Where is he!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.720
Hey! Are you after him, too!?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.720
That's right!
He's our target!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.160
Hey, where is he?

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:22.060
If you don't tell me I won't be able
to pay you for the food here, either!

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:24.400
He's at Desburg Botanical Garden!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.900
A botanical garden?

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:30.070
That's right! So you'd
better pay up this time!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:32.070
Hey, what happened to Eve?

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.070
Huh?

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:35.740
Oh? The wanted
poster's gone, too...

00:15:55.100 --> 00:15:59.430
The garden is closing soon.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:01.030
Who are you?

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:04.370
It seems I've
forgotten my name.

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.710
Really?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:11.040
For a long time, I've only dealt
with flowers and trees, so...

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:14.720
Flowers don't do things
like call people by name, right?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.380
You like flowers and trees?

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:19.390
I like them a lot.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:23.390
More than humans?

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:26.830
I'm surprised you
understand, young lady...

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.730
Eve!

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:33.400
But, I'm really touched
you're so worried about Eve.

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.400
Crap! At this rate, I'm going
to lose the competition!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:41.070
Hey, that's not the issue here!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:43.080
Train, wait! No, wait,
you don't have to wait!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.570
In any case, find Eve!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:51.420
I think that nothing in this world
is quite so pretty as flowers.

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:55.090
They show their beautiful
form in each season.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:57.090
Look...

00:16:57.090 --> 00:17:00.690
They are my sweethearts...

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:03.360
Igor Planter...

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:07.700
This is your name, isn't it?

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:08.700
Yeah...

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.700
I found you...

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:12.370
Are you playing tag?

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:15.040
I'm "it"...

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:18.710
What a cute "it" you are!

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:20.050
That's...

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.720
I'm a sweeper...

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:25.390
Are you saying that you're
going to apprehend me?

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.720
I didn't do anything wrong...

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:30.390
You killed many people,
didn't you?

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.060
All I did was teach a lesson to hikers
who contaminated the forest.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:36.230
They trampled on flowers
that posed no threat to them,

00:17:36.230 --> 00:17:38.400
and they tore flowers
from the ground...

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.420
But you shouldn't kill...

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:46.230
Young lady, are you,
also one of them?

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.420
Don't step on the flowers!!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:59.080
You have a cute face, and yet,
you trample on flowers, too!?

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:10.030
Eve!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:12.700
You'll be o-!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.700
- kay now...

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:19.540
I must punish bad children
who mess up the flowerbeds!

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:34.050
Stop it, you monster!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:39.390
The trees and forests are angry.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:42.090
You can hear their
angry voices, right?

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:46.730
You can't get out of this
greenhouse, young lady...

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:49.400
You're gonna die here!

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.740
Stop right there!!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:53.400
Is that...
performance art?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.080
Does it hurt?

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.670
But you'll feel better soon.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:11.020
You'll now be eaten by a flower
and reborn as a plant.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.690
Isn't that wonderful?

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.360
Wh- who's there!?

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:18.030
A sweeper!

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:22.370
Sorry for keeping you
waiting, princess!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:27.300
It makes no difference
how many of you come.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.540
I feel it!

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.380
You don't know
when to give up, pops!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:40.050
Do you like flowers?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:40.990
What?

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.390
M- my eyes!

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:48.060
Can you use
your gun like that?

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.220
Train!

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:53.630
This is it for both of you!

00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.930
Let those two go!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:03.740
Dammit!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:08.420
What the hell
are you doing!?

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.420
Don't shoot!

00:20:09.420 --> 00:20:10.410
What!?

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:44.450
Guns don't work on me.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.790
I'm now invincible!

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:50.120
That's right!
I'm invincible!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:52.790
Ha! He's pretty persistent...

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.790
Die!!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.660
I won't let you get away!!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.900
My body... my body is-!

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:12.910
Someone... help me!

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.080
How ruthless...

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:22.760
Now I feel sorry for him...

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.760
I win, princess.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.430
That man's body destroyed itself.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.760
What!? I rescued you, remember!?

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:32.430
As if you yourself
weren't in danger...

00:21:32.430 --> 00:21:34.100
Dummy! I was pretending!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:35.440
I did that on purpose!

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.500
Shinkitou?

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.770
Is this all!?

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:45.110
There's no way we'll get paid
when our target looks like that!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.450
You really are a pops
who has no luck with money.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:49.780
Shut up!

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:54.120
If you're in that much trouble,
why don't you help me with my job?

00:22:11.840 --> 00:22:16.880
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:20.880
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:26.650
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:41.570
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.570 --> 00:22:47.340
<i>Around the time the first evening star</i>
<i>appears, I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:47.340 --> 00:22:53.250
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:56.250
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:59.480
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:02.850
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.850 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:14.530
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:17.540
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:20.870
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:23.710
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:27.210
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:33.550
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:42.090
"Next Episode"

00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:43.430
Kyoko here!
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:46.430
I'm traveling with
Charden-<i>san</i> to gather allies.

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:49.100
But, I'm getting sick and tired of it
'cause they're all weird guys.

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:52.770
Oh, where's my prince?

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:54.440
According to a fortune-telling book,

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:57.110
let me see, my love
fortune for next week is...

00:23:57.110 --> 00:23:59.780
...excellent!?
And, lucky items are...

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:01.710
...popsicles and a black cat!?

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:02.910
Alrighty!! I'll have to give it
everything I've got!

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:05.780
"Charming Cat"
Alrighty!! I'll have to give it
everything I've got!
